      </a>\n        \n              <p>Truman Dickerson You're currently following this author! 想要取消关注吗？ 通过电子邮件中的链接取消订阅。</p></div>\n        \n            <div>\n              <p>杜鲁门·迪克森 (Truman Dickerson) 是《商业内幕》的周末新闻研究员，驻纽约市。 他报道热门科技和商业新闻。 他此前曾为《波士顿环球报》的 Express Desk 进行报道。 他毕业于波士顿大学，曾担任波士顿大学学生报纸《自由日报》的主编。请通过 Tdickerson@insider.com 与他联系</p>\n              </div>\n          </div>\n    \n          \n          \n          \n          <div data-component-type=\"post-category-tags\" data-load-strategy=\"lazy\" data-track-marfeel=\"post-category-tags\">\n            <ul data-track-click-shared=\"{&quot;product_field&quot;:&quot;bi_value_unassigned&quot;,&quot;event&quot;:&quot;navigation&quot;,&quot;element_name&quot;:&quot;category_link&quot;}\">\n                \n                <li>\n                  <a data-track-click=\"\" href=\"/category/meta\" title=\"Meta\">Meta</a>\n                </li>      \n                <li>\n                  <a data-track-click=\"\" href=\"/category/ai\" title=\"AI\">AI</a>\n                </li>\n          \n            </ul>\n          </div>\n        </section>\n    \n    \n          <section data-track-page-area=\"Post Bottom\">\n          <!-- Included desktop \"taboola\" -->    <vendor-taboola data-component-type=\"vendor-taboola\" data-root-margin=\"0px 0px 100% 0px\" data-consent=\"MARKETING\" config=\"{&quot;providerName&quot;:&quot;taboola&quot;,&quot;providerPageType&quot;:{&quot;article&quot;:&quot;auto&quot;},&quot;providerUrl&quot;:&quot;https://cdn.taboola.com/libtrc/businessinsider/loader.js&quot;,&quot;providerPrivacyLoader&quot;:&quot;https://static.tblcontent.com/libtrc/businessinsider/loader.privacy.js&quot;,&quot;providerPixel&quot;:&quot;https://static.qovani.com/libtrc/tr5?type=pixel&publisher=businessinsider&quot;,&quot;providerFlushValue&quot;:{&quot;flush&quot;:true},&quot;providerData&quot;:{&quot;mode&quot;:&quot;thumbs-1r&quot;,&quot;container&quot;:&quot;taboola-below-main-column&quot;,&quot;placement&qu